DESCRIPTION >
    Temporary: output of cdp_segment_aggregates_diff_tmp_copy, used to measure the change detection
    for the daily aggregate sinks before they are switched to v2. To be deleted after the measurement
    (linuxfoundation/lfx-cdp-insights-ops#1146).

SCHEMA >
    `kind` LowCardinality(String),
    `level` LowCardinality(String),
    `reason` LowCardinality(String),
    `segmentId` String,
    `entityId` String,
    `activityCount` UInt64,
    `memberCount` UInt64,
    `lastActive` DateTime64(3),
    `updatedAt` DateTime

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY kind, level, segmentId, entityId
